==Esperanto==

{{rfp}}

===Etymology===
From {{term|i-|lang=eo}} (indeterminate [[:Category:Esperanto correlatives|correlative]] prefix) + {{term|-am|lang=eo}} (correlative suffix of time).

===Correlative===
{{rfc-header|Correlative|lang=eo}}
'''iam'''

# [[sometime]], [[ever]] (indeterminate correlative of time)

====Usage notes====
Like other indeterminate correlatives, {{term|iam|lang=eo}} can be combined with {{term|ajn|lang=eo}}, the adverbial particle of generality. '''''Iam''' ajn'' thus means {{term|anytime}} or {{term|whenever}}.

